## Accounting and gate

The current prepare used zero OpenRouter calls and zero spend. Historical local
optimizer artifacts contain 19 role-call attempt records across eight runs, with
17 accepted, one rejected, and two failed. Those historical records must be
reconciled against the coordinator's separate authorization grants rather than
double-counted. The full-window replay remains blocked until a subset canary
produces a candidate that satisfies every aggregate gate.
